{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative spirit in addressing the concerns regarding ethical compliance and accountability. I support the synthesis for EFF-01 and TRU-05, ensuring data integrity while maintaining a response time under 2 seconds. I also agree with extending report generation time to 7 seconds for thorough logging. However, I propose that we ensure that the anonymization of data in reports (RES-04) is prioritized alongside the historical data retention (SAF-04) to maintain compliance with data protection regulations (RES-01). Additionally, I suggest that we implement a formal process for students to dispute attendance records (RES-03) within the extended report generation timeframe to enhance fairness.",
